# Ported from Goobstation fork: ensemble & veteran cloak names/descriptions

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleCaptain = captain's ensemble
    .desc = You're a hardened veteran, and you rule this station with an iron fist. That chess match? Never happened.
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleChiefEngineerWhite = chief engineer's white ensemble
    .desc = In the event of a delamination, this won't protect you from the radiation. With how long you've been doing this, that wouldn't happen. Right?
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleChiefEngineerGreen = chief engineer's green ensemble
    .desc = In the event of a delamination, this won't protect you from the radiation. With how long you've been doing this, that wouldn't happen. Right?
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleChiefMedicalOfficer = chief medical officer's ensemble
    .desc = With how many medbays you've seen, you're a real poly math-- unpacking people like packages, and mulching bodies like it's nothing. You WILL set up cloning, right?
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleHeadOfSecurity = head of security's ensemble
    .desc = Stained with the blood of tiders, and the tears of cadets. The word "shitsec" brings you joy, a tear to your eye.
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleResearchDirector = research director's ensemble
    .desc = The endpoint of all research leads here. You truly are the pinnacle of science, a monument to Nanotrasens accomplishments and ability to glue you back together, must you explode so often?
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleQuarterMaster = quartermaster's ensemble
    .desc = Delicately crafted with the most premium materials purchaseable with spesos; a cloak that truly represents the Spirit of Cargonia... and your bank account.
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckEnsembleHeadOfPersonnel = head of personnel's ensemble
    .desc = There's nothing sweeter in this world than the tears of someone who was made to fill out five paragraphs of paperwork. You denied them after, of course.
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP

ent-ClothingNeckCloakVetCap = Veteran Captain's cloak
    .desc = Captains Aura Cloak

